        "Current formal responsibilities and appointment procedures across relevant ministries, federations, provincial bodies, and clubs.",
        "Current officeholders and women’s representation at each management level.",
        "Actual control over budgets, personnel, scheduling, and competition decisions.",
        "Full-text methods and findings of both cited management studies.",
        "Recent independently documented reforms and their outcomes."
